    "description_html": "<p><strong>Introducing Our Premium Wooden Pencil!</strong></p>\n<p>Experience the perfect blend of elegance and functionality with our round wooden pencil. Featuring a luxurious gold ferrule and a pristine white eraser, this pencil is designed to impress.</p>\n<p><strong>Vibrant Color Options</strong>: Choose from a range of popular colors to match your style. Our pencils are available with full-color digital printing, ensuring your design stands out.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Unsharpened for Customization</strong>: Each pencil comes unsharpened, allowing you to personalize the sharpening to your preference.</li>\n<li><strong>Generous Print Area</strong>: Enjoy a digital print area of 130 x 4mm, perfect for showcasing your logo or message.</li>\n<li><strong>High-Quality Lead</strong>: Equipped with HB lead, our pencils provide smooth and consistent writing.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hassle-Free Ordering</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup costs.</li>\n<li><strong>No Design Fees</strong>: Enjoy the freedom to create without worrying about design charges.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Premium Wooden Pencil Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Elevate your writing experience with a pencil that combines style, quality, and convenience.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>No setup fees. No design fees!</strong></p>"
